          "html": "<b>A段</b><br>"
        },
        {
          "id": "annotation-e8be05ca-ca8d-491e-ac59-d508fbdf23aa",
          "trackId": "track-932bb3eb-165e-4b5f-8b0a-42585095b56b",
          "beat": 0,
          "frequency": 75.99592225605906,
          "html": "<b>对于旋律的纯律化，优先保证和弦音的纯粹</b><br>"
        },
        {
          "id": "annotation-bdb8ace0-6041-4cbe-8f69-763f3b164d14",
          "trackId": "track-932bb3eb-165e-4b5f-8b0a-42585095b56b",
          "beat": 34,
          "frequency": 352.7287937988501,
          "html": "<b>属七≠小七</b><br>"
        },
        {
          "id": "annotation-e604efda-1b91-4044-9413-99e6c0ff010f",
          "trackId": "track-932bb3eb-165e-4b5f-8b0a-42585095b56b",
          "beat": 93,
          "frequency": 476.93619148123224,
          "html": "<b>A‘段</b><br>"
        },
        {
          "id": "annotation-94ee9587-778e-4de1-af88-2e9ee67855b9",
          "trackId": "track-932bb3eb-165e-4b5f-8b0a-42585095b56b",
          "beat": 48,
          "frequency": 98.46872304490842,
          "html": "<b>转调，频率比完全不同。\n注意音名\n来自Cm的Ab不等于来自E7的G#</b>"
        },
        {
          "id": "annotation-2ec3ca5e-1aca-411f-bfcc-9e8e909aafa1",
          "trackId": "track-932bb3eb-165e-4b5f-8b0a-42585095b56b",
          "beat": 48,
          "frequency": 377.064144043737,
          "html": "<b>B段</b>"
        },
        {
          "id": "annotation-3d222ba4-2387-4d28-80c0-a1492621b22c",
          "trackId": "track-932bb3eb-165e-4b5f-8b0a-42585095b56b",
          "beat": 0,
          "frequency": 50.952626668072924,
          "html": "<b> 教程：\n\n 点击 🖊 编辑音符，点击音符构建纯律和声\n\n CTRL切换到选择 T切换到注释文本</b><br>"
        }
      ]
    }
